<title>CHINA: CHASE HK BRANCH PLACES HK$50 MLN CD.</title>
<headline>CHASE HK BRANCH PLACES HK$50 MLN CD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chase Manhattan Bank Hong Kong branch has lodged a HK$50 million fixed rate certificate of deposit issue with the Hong Kong Monetary Authority Central Moneymarkets Unit.</p>
<p>The 6.85 percent certificates due August 8, 1999, were issued at par.</p>
<p>Chase Manhattan Asia is the lead manager and paying agent.</p>
<p>The minimum denomination is HK$1.0 million.</p>
<p>The payment date is August 8.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
